---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { getTranslations } from '../../i18n/translations';

const locale = 'en';
const t = getTranslations(locale);
const lastUpdated = 'September 22, 2026';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy & Cookies | RobloxCodes.org"
  description="Privacy and Cookie Policy for RobloxCodes.org in full compliance with GDPR, CCPA, and Google AdSense partner guidelines."
  locale={locale}
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 space-y-8">
    
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="space-y-2 border-b border-white/10 pb-6">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-indigo-500/20">
        <span>🔒</span>
        <span>Legal Transparency & Data Protection</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-white tracking-tight">
        Privacy & Cookie Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">
        Last Updated: {lastUpdated} • Compliant with GDPR (EU), CCPA (California), and Google AdSense Policies.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Content Sections -->
    <div class="space-y-6 text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
      
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">1. Data Controller & Scope</h2>
        <p>
          At <strong>RobloxCodes.org</strong> (referred to as "the Portal" or "We"), we are committed to safeguarding the digital privacy of our visitors. This policy outlines what data we process, how advertising cookies operate, and your legal rights when browsing our game guides and codes.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">2. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>
          Accessing our Roblox codes and gaming tier lists is <strong>100% free and open</strong>. We never ask for Roblox account passwords, login credentials, or credit card information.
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-slate-400">
          <li><strong>Technical & Usage Data:</strong> Anonymized IP addresses, browser types, device information, and time-on-page metrics collected via secure analytics cookies to maintain high site performance.</li>
          <li><strong>Voluntary Contact Information:</strong> If you submit a query or report an expired code via our contact form, we only record the email address and message content you provide to respond to you.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Crucial Google AdSense Disclosure Section -->
      <section class="space-y-3 bg-[#0d1322] border border-indigo-500/30 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-indigo-400 font-bold text-base">
          <span>📢</span>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">3. Third-Party Advertising & Google AdSense DoubleClick Cookies</h2>
        </div>
        <p>
          This website works with <strong>Google AdSense</strong> and authorized digital advertising networks to display relevant programmatic ads. Under Google’s mandatory publisher policies:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-slate-300">
          <li>
            Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on a user's prior visits to this website or other internet websites.
          </li>
          <li>
            Google's use of advertising cookies (such as the <em>DoubleClick DART</em> cookie) enables it and its partners to serve ads to users based on their visit to our sites and/or other sites across the web.
          </li>
          <li>
            Users may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting 
            <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-indigo-400 underline ml-1">
              Google Ads Settings
            </a>.
            Alternatively, users can opt out of a third-party vendor's use of cookies for personalized advertising by visiting 
            <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-indigo-400 underline ml-1">
              www.aboutads.info
            </a>.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">4. Cookie Management & Consent (GDPR / ePrivacy)</h2>
        <p>
          Cookies are small text strings saved on your browser. We utilize essential session cookies (for remembering language toggles and consent status) alongside optional analytical and advertising cookies.
        </p>
        <p>
          You may modify or withdraw your cookie preferences anytime via your browser settings or by utilizing the bottom Cookie Consent Banner.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">5. Your Legal Rights (GDPR & CCPA)</h2>
        <p>
          Subject to applicable laws, you hold the right to request access to, correction of, or erasure of any personal contact data you have submitted to us. To submit a request, contact our team directly through our Contact page.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">6. External Hyperlinks</h2>
        <p>
          Our platform includes hyperlinks pointing to official Roblox Corporation web pages (e.g., <em>roblox.com/redeem</em>). We assume no control or liability over the privacy practices of third-party domains.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
